<section id="sbs-final" class="sbs-final-stage" hidden aria-label="Final artwork stages">
 <section id="sbs-final-downloads" class="sbs-card" aria-labelledby="sbs-final-download-title">
  <h2 id="sbs-final-download-title">Download a workspace file</h2>
  <p id="sbs-final-download-workspace" role="status">Choose a workspace first.</p>
  <label>Exact saved file to download<select id="sbs-final-download-file"><option value="">Choose a file — no file selected</option></select></label>
  <p>Choose an original, a saved artwork version, a treatment result or a web mockup. Selecting a download does not change the artwork you are editing.</p>
  <img id="sbs-final-download-preview" class="sbs-final-download-preview" alt="Selected download preview" hidden>
  <p id="sbs-final-download-detail" role="status">Select a file to see its preview and filename.</p>
  <a id="sbs-final-download-link" class="sbs-button primary" hidden>Download selected file</a>
 </section>
 <p id="sbs-final-project" class="sbs-final-readout" role="status">Choose a saved artwork or import a high-resolution PNG.</p>
 <details id="sbs-final-entry"><summary>Open another saved artwork / import high-resolution PNG</summary>
  <label>Studio Library<select id="sbs-final-sources"><option value="">Choose saved artwork</option></select></label>
  <button type="button" class="sbs-button" id="sbs-final-open">Open selected artwork</button>
  <form id="sbs-final-import"><label>Artwork title<input id="sbs-final-import-title" maxlength="150" required></label><label>High-resolution transparent PNG — up to 64 MB (host limit applies)<input type="file" id="sbs-final-import-file" accept="image/png" required></label><button class="sbs-button" type="submit">Import PNG — no upscale or AI scan</button></form>
  <p>Imports keep the original bytes. Technical checks run locally; previous saved Studio candidates keep their existing checks. Drive packages can be reopened by importing their clean PNG; they are preserved as separate workspaces. A Drive URL alone does not import a package.</p>
 </details>
 <button type="button" id="sbs-final-load" class="sbs-button primary">Load current candidate into this stage</button>
 <section id="sbs-final-finish" class="sbs-card">
  <h2 tabindex="-1">2 Final Finish</h2>
  <p>Choose a finish, or keep this artwork unchanged. No image generation or upscaling is used here.</p>
  <label>Treatment<select id="sbs-final-preset"><option value="original">Keep Original / No Extra Finish</option><option value="clean">Clean Retro</option><option value="vintage">Vintage 70/20/10</option><option value="period">Period Illustration</option><option value="custom">Custom / Fine-tune</option></select></label>
  <div class="sbs-final-actions"><button type="button" id="sbs-final-apply" class="sbs-button">Apply finish as new candidate</button><button type="button" id="sbs-final-keep" class="sbs-button primary">Keep Original &amp; Continue</button></div>
  <details><summary>Fine-tune and protected areas</summary><label>Finish strength<input id="sbs-final-strength" type="range" min="0" max="1" step=".05" value=".25"></label><p>All areas are protected from repeating textures by default. Tonal softening affects colour only. For selective RGB halftone, mark shadow/decorative areas below. Keep skin, clothes, boots, faces and lettering outside these areas. Flattened images are not automatically segmented.</p><label><input type="checkbox" id="sbs-final-zone-mode"> Select a texture rectangle by dragging on the clean preview</label><button id="sbs-final-zone-clear" type="button" class="sbs-button">Clear texture areas — protect everything</button><p id="sbs-final-zones-count">No texture areas selected.</p><div class="sbs-final-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="sbs-final-mask" width="700" height="700" aria-label="Select decorative shadow areas; all other areas are protected"></canvas></div><p>70/20/10 describes the intended aesthetic balance. It is not a pixel quota. These presets use restrained tonal changes and optional RGB dots; no alpha holes or random distress are introduced.</p></details>
  <div class="sbs-final-compare"><figure><figcaption>Clean high-resolution source</figcaption><div><img id="sbs-final-clean" alt="Unchanged clean source"></div></figure><figure><figcaption>Selected finish</figcaption><div><img id="sbs-final-candidate" alt="Finish candidate for comparison"></div></figure></div>
  <p id="sbs-final-treatment-download-detail" role="status">Apply a treatment or choose Keep Original to save a downloadable result.</p>
  <a id="sbs-final-treatment-download" class="sbs-button primary" hidden>Download this treated PNG</a>
  <div class="sbs-final-actions"><button type="button" id="sbs-final-toggle" class="sbs-button">Toggle clean / finish</button><button type="button" id="sbs-final-zoom" class="sbs-button">Toggle 2× comparison zoom</button><button type="button" id="sbs-final-difference" class="sbs-button">Show changed areas</button></div><canvas id="sbs-final-diff" width="700" height="700" hidden aria-label="Changed RGB/alpha area overlay"></canvas>
  <p id="sbs-final-finish-qa" class="sbs-final-qa" role="status">Technical: NOT CHECKED · Visual: NOT CHECKED</p>
  <button type="button" id="sbs-final-check" class="sbs-button">Check finished artwork</button>
  <button type="button" id="sbs-final-vision" class="sbs-button">Optional whole-design visual check — AI credits</button><div id="sbs-final-visual-findings"></div>
  <label><input type="checkbox" id="sbs-final-visual"> I reviewed the whole design, text, face, normal skin/clothes/boots and the four garment colours.</label><label><input type="checkbox" id="sbs-final-warnings"> I reviewed and accept the technical and print limitations.</label>
  <button type="button" id="sbs-final-accept" class="sbs-button primary">Approve finish &amp; continue to Logo &amp; Mockup</button>
 </section>
 <section id="sbs-final-brand" class="sbs-card" hidden>
  <h2 tabindex="-1">3 Logo &amp; Mockup</h2>
  <div class="sbs-final-actions"><button type="button" id="sbs-final-brand-original" class="sbs-button">Use loaded source unchanged — no finish</button><button type="button" id="sbs-final-source-approve" class="sbs-button">Approve unchanged source after review</button></div><p id="sbs-final-source-qa" role="status"></p><label id="sbs-final-source-review-row" hidden><input type="checkbox" id="sbs-final-source-reviewed"> I reviewed the unchanged source, its text, details, transparency and technical warnings.</label>
  <label>Approved series logo<select id="sbs-final-logo"><option value="none">None — keep unbranded</option></select></label><button type="button" id="sbs-final-manage" class="sbs-button">Manage logos and T-shirt templates</button>
  <p>Drag the selected logo with one finger. Centre horizontally changes X only; arrows make fine adjustments. Whole-shirt placement below is separate.</p>
  <div class="sbs-final-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="sbs-final-logo-canvas" width="800" height="800" aria-label="Artwork with movable selected logo"></canvas></div>
  <div class="sbs-final-pad" aria-label="Logo movement"><span></span><button type="button" data-logo-move="up" class="sbs-button" aria-label="Move logo up">↑</button><span></span><button type="button" data-logo-move="left" class="sbs-button" aria-label="Move logo left">←</button><button type="button" id="sbs-final-centre" class="sbs-button">Centre X</button><button type="button" data-logo-move="right" class="sbs-button" aria-label="Move logo right">→</button><span></span><button type="button" data-logo-move="down" class="sbs-button" aria-label="Move logo down">↓</button></div>
  <div class="sbs-final-actions"><span>LOGO SIZE</span><button id="sbs-final-smaller" type="button" class="sbs-button" aria-label="Decrease logo width">−</button><button id="sbs-final-larger" type="button" class="sbs-button" aria-label="Increase logo width">+</button><button id="sbs-final-undo" type="button" class="sbs-button">Undo logo move / size</button></div><p id="sbs-final-logo-size" class="sbs-final-readout"></p>
  <details><summary>Advanced logo controls / curve signature</summary><label>Nudge step<select id="sbs-final-step"><option value=".002">Fine — 0.2% of artwork</option><option value=".01">Coarse — 1% of artwork</option></select></label><button id="sbs-final-centre-visible" type="button" class="sbs-button">Centre on visible artwork</button><label><input type="checkbox" id="sbs-final-curve"> Curve approved single-line signature</label><label>Selected bend<select id="sbs-final-bend"><option value="0">Bend 1</option><option value="1">Bend 2</option></select></label><button id="sbs-final-add-bend" type="button" class="sbs-button">Add second bend point</button><div class="sbs-final-actions"><button type="button" data-bend="left" class="sbs-button">Bend ←</button><button type="button" data-bend="right" class="sbs-button">Bend →</button><button type="button" data-bend="up" class="sbs-button">Bend ↑</button><button type="button" data-bend="down" class="sbs-button">Bend ↓</button><button id="sbs-final-straight" type="button" class="sbs-button">Reset straight</button></div><p>Red bend handles and selection guides never print. Curved raster signatures are separate review derivatives; inspect small letters at print size.</p></details>
  <button type="button" id="sbs-final-save-brand" class="sbs-button primary">Save branded candidate / confirm No logo</button><p id="sbs-final-brand-qa" class="sbs-final-qa" role="status">Branding: NOT CHECKED</p><label><input type="checkbox" id="sbs-final-brand-review"> I reviewed logo readability, overlap, clipping and print size, and accept its warnings.</label><button id="sbs-final-brand-approve" type="button" class="sbs-button">Approve branded candidate</button>
  <button type="button" id="sbs-final-brand-vision" class="sbs-button">Optional branded-art visual check — AI credits</button><div id="sbs-final-brand-findings"></div>
  <h3>T-shirt preview</h3><p>Generic visual reference / not measured. Shirt and ink colour, folds, white underbase and actual print size are approximations.</p>
  <div class="sbs-final-grid"><label>T-shirt template<select id="sbs-final-template"><option value="generic">Generic front — four colours</option></select></label><label>Proof background<select id="sbs-final-colour"><option value="black">Black</option><option value="white">White</option><option value="red">Red</option><option value="navy">Navy</option></select></label><label>Preview mode<select id="sbs-final-view"><option value="photo">Photographic visual reference</option><option value="flat">Flat colour / print-area diagnostic</option></select></label><label>Supplier / product<select id="sbs-final-product"><option value="standard">Redbubble Standard / Essential — 2400 × 3200</option><option value="premium">Redbubble Premium — 2875 × 3900</option><option value="graphic">Redbubble Graphic all-over — 3873 × 4814</option><option value="gelato">Gelato — nominal 12 × 16 inch file area, unverified physical print</option></select></label><label>Garment size reference<select id="sbs-final-garment-size"><option>S</option><option selected>M</option><option>L</option><option>XL</option><option>Custom</option></select></label></div>
  <div class="sbs-final-canvas-wrap"><canvas id="sbs-final-shirt" width="800" height="820" aria-label="Shirt proof with non-printing placement and anatomical guides"></canvas></div>
  <div class="sbs-final-actions"><button type="button" id="sbs-final-fit" class="sbs-button">Fit artwork — no cropping</button><button type="button" data-shirt="left" class="sbs-button">Print ←</button><button type="button" data-shirt="right" class="sbs-button">Print →</button><button type="button" data-shirt="up" class="sbs-button">Print ↑</button><button type="button" data-shirt="down" class="sbs-button">Print ↓</button><button type="button" data-shirt="smaller" class="sbs-button">Print size −</button><button type="button" data-shirt="larger" class="sbs-button">Print size +</button></div><p id="sbs-final-placement" class="sbs-final-readout" role="status"></p>
  <details><summary>Physical reference, supplier uncertainty and Torsotopia alignment</summary><p>Product image pixels and uploader sliders do not establish printed millimetres or a garment size. S/M/L/XL scaling is unverified. Standard adapted and Premium full-torso layouts are separate configurations; no automatic body-size stretching occurs.</p><label>Print-region width in mm — reference estimate<input id="sbs-final-mm" type="number" min="50" max="1000" value="355.6"></label><label>Calibration evidence / garment brand, model, size and date<input id="sbs-final-evidence" maxlength="1000" placeholder="Unverified — enter source or your worn-shirt measurements"></label><label>Hypothetical garment-size scaling<select id="sbs-final-scaling"><option value="unknown">UNKNOWN — no actual size claim</option><option value="fixed">Hypothesis: fixed print width</option><option value="proportional">Hypothesis: proportional to shirt width</option><option value="capped">Hypothesis: capped scale-down on small sizes</option></select></label><p>These hypotheses are saved for comparison, never applied as a verified supplier rule.</p>
   <label>Torso alignment<select id="sbs-final-torso"><option value="none">Normal artwork — no anatomy requirement</option><option value="T1">T1 Upper pec / nipple targets</option><option value="T2">T2 Full torso / navel</option></select></label><label>Torso product layout<select id="sbs-final-torso-layout"><option value="premium-full">Premium full torso</option><option value="standard-adapted">Standard adapted composition</option><option value="pec-only">Upper pec only</option></select></label><label><input id="sbs-final-guides" type="checkbox" checked> Show non-printing guides</label><label>Move marker<select id="sbs-final-marker"><option value="none">Move whole print</option><option value="NL">Shirt wearer-left nipple (image right)</option><option value="NR">Shirt wearer-right nipple (image left)</option><option value="B">Shirt navel</option><option value="AL">Artwork wearer-left nipple</option><option value="AR">Artwork wearer-right nipple</option><option value="AB">Artwork navel</option><option value="S">Artwork sternum / midline</option></select></label><div class="sbs-final-actions"><button type="button" data-marker-move="left" class="sbs-button">Marker ←</button><button type="button" data-marker-move="right" class="sbs-button">Marker →</button><button type="button" data-marker-move="up" class="sbs-button">Marker ↑</button><button type="button" data-marker-move="down" class="sbs-button">Marker ↓</button></div><button type="button" id="sbs-final-align" class="sbs-button">Suggest proportional torso alignment</button><button type="button" id="sbs-final-reference" class="sbs-button">Restore provisional male reference</button><button type="button" id="sbs-final-overlay" class="sbs-button">Download non-printing placement overlay</button><p>Baseline: approximate 23 cm nipple separation, 39 cm notch-to-navel, nipple level at 42% of that span. Published averages are provisional design references, not your body measurements. Drag markers or use marker arrows, then save a garment-specific reference. A proportional alignment cannot independently stretch the chest and navel into place.</p><p id="sbs-final-anatomy" role="status">Anatomical placement: NOT CHECKED</p>
  </details>
  <div class="sbs-final-actions"><button type="button" id="sbs-final-save-settings" class="sbs-button">Save editable placement settings</button><button type="button" id="sbs-final-proofs" class="sbs-button primary">Make web shirt proofs</button></div><div id="sbs-final-proofs-list" class="sbs-final-proofs"></div>
  <h3>Export Studio Package</h3><label>Two-letter series prefix<input id="sbs-final-prefix" pattern="[A-Za-z]{2}" maxlength="2"></label><label><input id="sbs-final-package-review" type="checkbox"> I checked placement, shirt proofs and any estimated measurements or anatomical warnings.</label><button type="button" id="sbs-final-export" class="sbs-button primary">Export Studio Package to SmuttyBear Drive</button><p>One versioned folder: original source, clean PNG, unique finished PNG, branded PNG if selected, manifests, checksums, QA and selected web proofs. No-finish outputs reference the same clean file and hash. This does not approve production or publish products.</p><div id="sbs-final-export-links"></div>
 </section>
 <p id="sbs-final-status" role="status" aria-live="polite">Choose a stage and load an artwork.</p>
 <dialog id="sbs-final-library-dialog" aria-labelledby="sbs-final-library-title"><h2 id="sbs-final-library-title">Logos and reusable shirt templates</h2><button type="button" id="sbs-final-library-close" class="sbs-button">Close</button><label>Existing imported asset<select id="sbs-final-library-item"><option value="">Add new asset</option></select></label><form id="sbs-final-library-form"><label>Asset type<select id="sbs-final-library-kind"><option value="logo">Approved transparent logo</option><option value="template">Blank T-shirt photo</option></select></label><label>Asset name<input id="sbs-final-library-label" maxlength="180" required></label><label>Source/licence note<input id="sbs-final-library-note" maxlength="3000" required></label><label>Source Drive file ID — optional<input id="sbs-final-library-source-id"></label><label>Series<select id="sbs-final-library-series"><option value="SB">Smutty Bear</option><option value="MB">Madam Butterfly</option><option value="PW">Piston Works</option><option value="TT">Torsotopia</option></select></label><label>Colour<input id="sbs-final-library-colour" maxlength="80"></label><label>Supplier / manufacturer / model<input id="sbs-final-library-model" maxlength="180"></label><label>Size label<input id="sbs-final-library-size" maxlength="80"></label><label>View<select id="sbs-final-library-view"><option value="front">Front</option><option value="back">Back</option></select></label><label>Source image / replacement (PNG, JPEG or WebP, up to 20 MB)<input id="sbs-final-library-file" type="file" accept="image/png,image/jpeg,image/webp"></label><img id="sbs-final-template-inspect" alt="Imported template crop and orientation preview" style="max-width:100%;max-height:350px" hidden><details><summary>Template print rectangle — normalized coordinates</summary><p>0–1 proportions of the original shirt image. Until physically verified this is visual geometry only.</p><div class="sbs-final-grid"><label>Left<input id="sbs-final-library-x" type="number" min="0" max="1" step=".01" value=".28"></label><label>Top<input id="sbs-final-library-y" type="number" min="0" max="1" step=".01" value=".24"></label><label>Width<input id="sbs-final-library-w" type="number" min=".01" max="1" step=".01" value=".44"></label><label>Height<input id="sbs-final-library-h" type="number" min=".01" max="1" step=".01" value=".59"></label></div></details><label><input id="sbs-final-library-signature" type="checkbox"> Single-line signature — permit optional curve mode</label><label><input id="sbs-final-library-approved" type="checkbox" required> I may use this image; a logo is the genuine approved master.</label><button type="submit" class="sbs-button" id="sbs-final-library-save">Save reusable asset version</button></form><button type="button" id="sbs-final-library-archive" class="sbs-button">Archive selected imported asset</button><p id="sbs-final-library-status" role="status"></p></dialog>
</section>
